<script setup lang="ts">import type { AnalyticsProfile } from "~/types/analytics"; defineProps<{profile:AnalyticsProfile;mutating:boolean}>(); const emit=defineEmits<{archive:[];restore:[]}>(); const copied=ref(false); async function copy(){if(import.meta.client){await navigator.clipboard?.writeText(location.href);copied.value=true;setTimeout(()=>copied.value=false,1500)}}</script>
<template><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 rounded-lg border bg-card p-3"><UiButton v-if="profile.data.actions.canEdit" as-child variant="outline"><NuxtLink :to="profile.data.actions.editPath">Ubah Data Lapangan</NuxtLink></UiButton><UiButton v-if="profile.data.actions.canArchive" type="button" variant="outline" class="border-amber-400" :disabled="mutating" @click="emit('archive')">{{ mutating ? 'Memproses…' : 'Arsipkan' }}</UiButton><UiButton v-if="profile.data.actions.canRestore" type="button" variant="outline" class="border-emerald-500" :disabled="mutating" @click="emit('restore')">{{ mutating ? 'Memproses…' : 'Pulihkan' }}</UiButton><UiButton type="button" variant="outline" @click="copy">{{ copied ? 'Tautan disalin' : 'Salin tautan internal' }}</UiButton><UiButton as-child variant="outline"><NuxtLink to="/dashboard/analitik">Kembali ke Analitik</NuxtLink></UiButton></div></template>
